unquoted string `a\5f b` as its value with escapes resolved in Dart Sass 3.0.0. For forwards-compatibility, use an unquoted string in canonical form instead:

Suggestion: meta.load-css(..., $with: (a_b: ...))

More info: https://sass-lang.com/d/meta-escape

